<view class="container">
 <view class="segmented mb"><view wx:for="{{audiences}}" wx:key="value" class="seg {{active === item.value ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="onAudienceTap">{{item.label}}</view></view>
 <view class="card"><view class="h3">选择现货 · 最多50台</view><input class="field mt" placeholder="型号 / 完整IMEI / 设备编号" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="onKeyword" bindconfirm="search" /><view class="row gap-sm mt"><button class="btn btn-line" bindtap="onScan">扫码查找</button><button class="btn btn-primary" loading="{{searching}}" bindtap="search">查找现货</button></view><view wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="id" class="list-item"><view><view>{{item.name}} {{item.storage}}</view><view class="tiny muted">{{item.color}} · {{item.imeiMasked}}</view></view><button class="btn btn-line btn-sm" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onAdd">加入</button></view></view>
 <section-card title="已选 {{selected.length}} 台"><view wx:if="{{!selected.length}}" class="muted">从上方查找并加入设备</view><view wx:for="{{selected}}" wx:key="id" class="list-item"><view>{{item.name}} {{item.storage}}<view class="tiny muted">{{item.imeiMasked}}</view></view><text class="gold" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onRemove">移除</text></view></section-card>
 <view wx:if="{{active === 'agent'}}" class="notice">代理分享由代理本人在“代理中心”生成并自行加价；门店只需在库存页开启“允许代理转发”。</view>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice">{{error}}</view>
 <button class="btn btn-primary mb" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{!selected.length || loading}}" bindtap="createLink">生成{{selected.length > 1 ? '合集' : '单机'}}分享</button>
 <view wx:if="{{share}}" class="card"><view class="h3">{{share.title}}</view><view class="tiny muted mt-sm">{{share.channel === 'peer' ? '同行授权可见' : '顾客零售价'}} · {{share.units.length}}台</view><view wx:for="{{share.units}}" wx:key="id" class="list-item"><view><view>{{item.name}} {{item.storage}} {{item.color}}</view><view class="small muted">{{item.desc || '未填写对外机况'}}</view></view><price-tag value="{{item.price}}" /></view><view class="row mt gap-sm"><button class="btn btn-line" bindtap="onPreview">预览</button><button class="btn btn-line" bindtap="onRevoke">撤销本链接</button></view></view>
 <view class="notice">分享价格由服务端决定。撤销、到期、改价或下架后，原链接失效。</view>
 <view class="footer-space"></view><view class="footer-bar"><button class="btn btn-line" disabled="{{!share}}" bindtap="onCopy">复制文案</button><button class="btn btn-line" disabled="{{!share}}" bindtap="onPoster">分享海报</button><button class="btn btn-primary" disabled="{{!share}}" open-type="share">转发</button></view>
</view>
